OL,3,AUK government approves Jackdaw gas
OL,4,Afield and says production will start
OL,5,Athis month
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut Energy Secretary Miatta Fahnbulleh
OL,8,Ftells the BBC the gas from Jackdaw
OL,9,F"won't lower energy bills this winter"
OL,10,F- our business editor says the new
OL,11,Ffield will contribute less than 3% of
OL,12,Fthe UK's gas needs
OL,14,FGreen Party leader in England and
OL,15,FWales, Zack Polanski, calls the Jackdaw
OL,16,Fdecision "climate vandalism"
OL,18,FConservative leader Kemi Badenoch backs
OL,19,Fthe decision, but accuses the
OL,20,Fgovernment of "faffing about"
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
