OL,3,AAberfan falls silent to mark 60 years
OL,4,Asince coal tip collapsed on school and
OL,5,Ahomes, killing 116 children and 28
OL,6,Aadults
OL,7,
OL,8,FEmergency services, miners and people
OL,9,Fwho rushed to the village began an
OL,10,Faround-the-clock battle to dig out
OL,11,Fthose trapped by the debris
OL,13,FA prayer and moment of silence will be
OL,14,Fheld at 09:15 to mark the moment, and a
OL,15,Fmale voice choir formed in the
OL,16,Faftermath of the disaster will sing
OL,18,FKing Charles, Queen Camilla and the
OL,19,FPrince of Wales will then join
OL,20,Fsurvivors, bereaved parents and other
OL,21,Fmembers of the community
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/41
