OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKatya Adler: France divided over who to
OL,4,Ablame for riots and what to learn from
OL,5,Athem
OL,6,
OL,7,FI'd stopped Elisabeth and her friend to
OL,8,Fask their thoughts on what happened on
OL,9,FSaturday. Elisabeth was so upset that,
OL,10,Fwhen she spoke, she seemed close to
OL,11,Ftears.
OL,13,F"My friend thinks this is civil war in
OL,14,FFrance but I don't. Saturday is about
OL,15,Fsomething else entirely."
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/41
