OL,5,
OL,6,FNugent was arrested moments after he
OL,7,Fallegedly drove his Toyota LandCruiser
OL,8,Finto the independent MP outside her
OL,9,Felectorate office in the regional town
OL,10,Fof Wangaratta, about 240km (150miles)
OL,11,Fnortheast of Melbourne.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG16/41
